creenshot5.png", "id": "190513696167216", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001687_190513699500549_814425097474291908_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9exNgNY_Ee4Q7kNvwEukXmf&_nc_oc=AdruiZxt_Ijl_YLVYs4EHHDEJT9vZN4I2KpFjyAmz9oPXr-_QjdjPNPBcADrPFgWdp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_WXpoxuBFtWjH4tgxKhsOqJxFp9t89Wcjpei6VXhIXxQ&oe=6A3AA653"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_cover.png", "id": "1195823440879067", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974917_1195823444212400_5305135154571797175_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rVpJ5G9DPt4Q7kNvwFtr0Gi&_nc_oc=AdqOL2MIE1P_fFrZDQxuaTB8to7UvOrJBh9ndAHqVH5LDaExq1j4D4_NqfwAVkHyqEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-TmDlvevTqKY85tECzit8ZvDu0UIXbyQ5P6XZb3sSj8Q&oe=6A3AAFA2"}, "display_name": "Ajax All Powerful: Original Edition", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ajax (Henry Winkler) is a foul-mouthed, double-crossing genie addicted to the human souls he collects in exchange for granting wishes to gullible humans. However, something is different about the seemingly-naive little girl who has rubbed his lamp this time. For one thing, she\u2019s hired a strait-laced lawyer (Chris Parnell) to negotiate her wishes, and they might have a trick or two buried in the new contract\u2019s legalese\u2026.\n\nWritten and directed by award-winning VR creator Ethan Shaftel (KAIJU CONFIDENTIAL, EXTRAVAGANZA), AJAX ALL POWERFUL is an innovative VR comedy utilizing behind-the-scenes interactive triggers to create a fluid world of changing sizes and perspectives as the story progresses from the lamp to the real world, and beyond.", "short_description": "Ajax (Henry Winkler) is a foul-mouthed genie addicted to the human souls he collects after tricking gullible masters. But something is different about the little girl who found his lamp this time: she's hire